      "id": "3718e2f8-9c74-4661-a518-9f7ac0d704c5",
      "name": "Client Credentials Access Token",
      "description": {
        "content": "If you are building a private OAuth app, it's likely easier to use Client Credentials rather than OAuth2.0 refresh tokens. Use the request in this folder to retreive an access_token for your private OAuth app using client credentials. The request includes a Postman script to add the returned access_token as a variable in the collection. To use this token in subsequent requests, adjust the authorization of the request to Bearer Token and add {{client_credentials_token}} in the token field.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
